Every element of a cell argument to 'strjoin' must be a character vector.
A cell of delimiters for 'strjoin' must have one fewer element than the cell it joins.
Inputs must be the same size or either one can be a scalar.
All the character arrays given to 'strcat' must have the same number of rows.
All the cell arrays given to 'strcat' must be the same size or have one element.
Precision for 'mat2str' must be a positive integer.
Input to 'mat2str' must be a numeric, logical or char matrix.
